script = ExtResource("1")
id = &"jinglestar"
display_name = "Jester's Jinglestar"
role = "The Castle Kingdom court jester's morningstar: a star-ball bell on a gold chain, swung in whipping figure-eights (FIRE) that reach a little further than a club and catch up to three zombies. Hold AIM to whirl it overhead, faster as it charges, and let go to slam it down. ENCORE: every swing that lands soon after the last speeds up the next; at a full encore every hit also rings a jingle shockwave round you. A miss, or a pause, ends the show. Heavies and alphas take less from every swing. The specialist's prize: unlocked by 500 melee kills."
